{"data":{"body":"**P1 \u2014 Preserve the winning durable control-flow failure.** If suspension or retryable termination completes `executionFuture`, but a `finally` block throws while unwinding, this selects `handlerFailure` and reports FAILED instead of PENDING/RETRYING. After waiting for cleanup, propagate the original `failure` unconditionally and test throwing-finally cases for waits and retryable termination.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc74oYIx","finding_digest":"0e3146402db9ff5307f948de09333af00bfc39ad99bb18ce0b204c8878bf145f","finding_id":"arf_v1_byyumqbnxh7vgb7zjdpasmz26a","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::execution-failure-precedence","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::execution-failure-precedence","line":222,"observation_digest":"c1a4bf9961666c5cfd91c834746ec08e331e9b020e3b6ced6bb44d25ab7447cc","observation_id":"aro_v1_ygsl7glbmzwfz7mrza2hi3wary","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-03T02:24:42Z","review_id":"arr_v1_lwhyr6w7ysbm6q6ylx77nxu7c2","reviewed_base_sha":"61f5d103651c2bafc54f840a539cf55a95f47df7","reviewed_head_sha":"24d53b4493ad0df0607e7b779b14b2b6a7dfb9fc","reviewer":"codex","start_line":218,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_tkcmgbwehhxy6cks43smprjxm2"},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_btvggtq2fl5rpw2xo2gdramuks","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-03T02:24:42Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
